{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-17T10:08:37.108Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"e6c75eb6477900f1d6cb8502","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/3","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-17T10:08:37.108Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"The full integration gate exposed a real diagnostic regression in the new dispatch helper: Bash ERR traps were not inherited by functions, so dispatch denial exited without the required token diagnostic. Set errtrace for the maintenance step and added fast denial regressions for both workflows. Fixed denial cases pass 2/2; reverting only errtrace fails 2/2. No protection was bypassed, and dispatch failure still exits before auto-merge. Full gates are being rerun with final code."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-17T10:08:37.108Z"}],"before_hash":"622c07ff4dfd231aeb7f3376e92898dede3b03bab7e8b148f5bf38a04a546e20","after_hash":"c8a2ca343564f288524032784460f73b239275b2c95322306dab177e0f6c8de3","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"da7a2ab79b45f93b07042fb1454079f6d74df5b469816279f84a94738097038e"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-17T10:18:08.976Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"e6c75eb6477900f1d6cb8502","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/4","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-17T10:18:08.975Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"The final PM-run regression suite passes 13/13 with zero skipped tests. Reverting only the maintenance bodies fails 12/13 cases; reverting only Bash error tracing fails both denial cases. All 24 audited callers already permit auto-merge and squash, so repository merge settings need no current change. Caller setup remains the documented CodeQL trigger, explicit CI override, and required-check policy declarations. Full npm/Bun CI-identity retries retain every assertion and threshold."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-17T10:18:08.976Z"}],"before_hash":"c8a2ca343564f288524032784460f73b239275b2c95322306dab177e0f6c8de3","after_hash":"4a904abd13b553f5ee488ec7f15e35a1f12cc888259f4143d543e7511319d275","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"cf7faaafb0ee339cef70efece458c483160aacf56a7efac64acda100bef63560"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-17T10:31:30.754Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"e6c75eb6477900f1d6cb8502","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/5","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-17T10:31:30.754Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Additional root cause verified in current GitHub documentation: workflow_dispatch job checks are excluded from PR evaluation and cannot satisfy required branch-rule checks, even when green on the head SHA. This explains the REST-versus-PR-checks discrepancy. Implement the documented GitHub App path: optional client ID plus private-key secret, mint a current-repository token only after local gates, use it for publication and refresh to trigger eligible native pull_request runs, and retain default GITHUB_TOKEN with an explicit setup notice. Native protections remain enforced; no copied or synthetic green statuses. App-enabled maintenance must end inside the one-hour token lifetime. Source: https://docs.github.com/en/pull-requests/how-tos/merge-and-close-pull-requests/troubleshooting-required-status-checks and https://docs.github.com/en/actions/how-tos/write-workflows/choose-when-workflows-run/trigger-a-workflow"}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-17T10:31:30.754Z"}],"before_hash":"4a904abd13b553f5ee488ec7f15e35a1f12cc888259f4143d543e7511319d275","after_hash":"1fb5ccbe7283a34c4a2d64885f225bf6e9dc5e504596d16e8402285fcbe4fedf","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"a3dfe8d8cbab64b44e52210e59690cd33b4ffa8a68fdb5092b5490d26306383e"}
